  "subTitleDesc": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CB26119",
    "sub_id": "29551",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "sub_title": null,
    "sub_title_en": "Brand Aesthetics, Immanuel Kant's Aesthetics, Judgement of taste, the first moment of disinterestedness, purposiveness, and creativity.",
    "sub_describe": null,
    "sub_describe_en": "this is a learning journey to understand and apply the theories of aesthetics to marketing exchange value. Aesthetic appealing is purposiveness, universal agreement and necessary satisfaction which add value to marketing exchange. Tea ceremony and coup ritual activity are designed to experience this non-verbal learning."
  },
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "美學與產品創意",
    "sub_ename": "AESTHETICS AND PRODUCT CREATIVITY",
    "describe_ch": "美學是時美學是時空自然流動中，五感舒暢或悸動的學問，優雅是一種結論，風格是一種定位。產品是一種空間量體的認知，消費是一種人與物之間時間流動的關係美學是時空自然流動中，五感舒暢或悸動的學問，優雅是一種結論，風格是一種定位。產品是一種空間量體的認知，消費是一種人與物之間時間流動的關係，讓學生在零基礎地培養美的直觀感受，美的真誠熱情，而形成原創的產品概念，藉由細細的品味人物之間、產品創意才有原創的可能，也才有穩固的學習行銷起始點。：\n(i)反應大自然流動的黃金比例。\n(ii) 做中學的體驗與日誌。\n(iii) 康德(Kent)的靜默直觀(disinteresting)更是行銷洞察的基礎功。\n(iv) 從日常生活中，從美術館、科博館、台中文創園區、廣告，形塑學生",
    "describe_eh": "Aesthetic is a discipline to inquiry of beauty. It is a conclusive positioning when a delight emotion is aroused to appreciate what human perceive an objects or environment. Such positioning is a reflection of the rhythm of ease or emotional flow, resulting from inter-change of time and space. Product could be seen as a three-dimension object. Consumption could be perceived as inter-change of time flow between product and consumer. Then inter-change of time and space could generate emotional beauty which is a marketing power to establish customer loyalty. This course is designed to lead students holding free-loading and zero-base manner to experience relationships between Kent's Disinteresting perception towards object and emotional beauty. Such capability of free-loading, disinteresting perceiving, and arousal of emotional beauty is thought to be the core construct of original creativity and only can be taught through experience learning. There are five dimensions of learning objectives: (1) the golden section 1:1.618, reflecting nature flow of beauty; (2) Chinese section 1:2 or German section 1:√2; (3) Learning by doing and document in learning diary; (4) capability of free-loading, disinteresting perceiving, and arousal of emotional beauty; (5) collections of marketing evidences in daily observations including TV ad, news ad, art museum, science museum, and cultural creative park, etc..",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
